+Feature Fusion combines multi-view 2D features into a single representation for 3D points or novel views [S2, unofficial][S1]. It sets itself apart from concatenation-based fusion by using max-pooling, which outperforms concatenation and allows a flexible architecture capable of handling any number of input neighbours [S1]. It builds on [Attention-based Multi-Position Density Prediction](10679-attention-based-multi-position-density-prediction.md) by aggregating attention-regulated features across views.
 
